{
  "_note": "引导屏的「常用城市」快捷键。`k` = 1..6,由 p-setup-hot.rcn 的 chip 以**字面数字**带进来。\n\n⚠️⚠️ **经纬度住在本文件的 i18n 表里,名字在两处各有一份**(这里 + p-setup-hot.rcn 的 `su_c1..su_c6`)。\n不得已:`.af` 的 `@i18n` 解的是**它自己文件的** A 表,读不到页面/资产的表;而 RCN 也读不到 af 的表。\n两张表**必须同序同城** —— 改一处就得改另一处,否则用户点的是「北京」、存进去的是别处的坐标,而且不报错。\n中英两档给的是**不同的城市清单**(中文档给国内常用,英文档给全球常用),这正是把它放进 A 表而不是写死的原因。\n\n⚠️ 坐标写成字符串:`data.cities` 里 lat/lon 一路都是字符串(home.df 直接串进 URL query),类型混着写会在某个端上变成 `31.2222000000000004`。\n⚠️ 与 setup-pick.af 的落盘/重载段逐字同源 —— 两条路都是「第一座城 → 立刻进正常首页」。",
  "version": 1,
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "loading": "正在获取天气…",
      "n1": "北京", "a1": "39.9042", "o1": "116.4074",
      "n2": "上海", "a2": "31.2222", "o2": "121.4581",
      "n3": "广州", "a3": "23.1291", "o3": "113.2644",
      "n4": "深圳", "a4": "22.5431", "o4": "114.0579",
      "n5": "成都", "a5": "30.5728", "o5": "104.0668",
      "n6": "香港", "a6": "22.3193", "o6": "114.1694"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "loading": "Fetching weather…",
      "n1": "New York", "a1": "40.7128", "o1": "-74.0060",
      "n2": "London", "a2": "51.5074", "o2": "-0.1278",
      "n3": "Tokyo", "a3": "35.6762", "o3": "139.6503",
      "n4": "Singapore", "a4": "1.3521", "o4": "103.8198",
      "n5": "Sydney", "a5": "-33.8688", "o5": "151.2093",
      "n6": "Los Angeles", "a6": "34.0522", "o6": "-118.2437"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "action": "ui.haptic"
    },
    {
      "_note": "入参落地(§9.5 #3):后续方法要读 flow 入参,必须先 op:set 落进 data 域。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ki",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${k},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 内层方法必须裸写(VParser:参数内的 $[] 不识别);`${@i18n.x}` 可以嵌在 $[if::()] 里(tubewatch 的日期链同式)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "name",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ki},1),${@i18n.n1},if::(eq::(${ki},2),${@i18n.n2},if::(eq::(${ki},3),${@i18n.n3},if::(eq::(${ki},4),${@i18n.n4},if::(eq::(${ki},5),${@i18n.n5},${@i18n.n6})))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lat",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ki},1),${@i18n.a1},if::(eq::(${ki},2),${@i18n.a2},if::(eq::(${ki},3),${@i18n.a3},if::(eq::(${ki},4),${@i18n.a4},if::(eq::(${ki},5),${@i18n.a5},${@i18n.a6})))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lon",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ki},1),${@i18n.o1},if::(eq::(${ki},2),${@i18n.o2},if::(eq::(${ki},3),${@i18n.o3},if::(eq::(${ki},4),${@i18n.o4},if::(eq::(${ki},5),${@i18n.o5},${@i18n.o6})))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "okLat",
        "value": "$[length::(${lat})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "同 setup-pick.af:坐标没求出来就什么都不写。空城市一旦落盘就是持久的。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[gt::(${okLat},0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "one",
            "value": [
              {
                "lat": "${lat}",
                "lon": "${lon}",
                "name": "${name}",
                "where": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "data.set",
          "params": {
            "key": "cities",
            "value": "${one}"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "ui.showLoading",
          "params": {
            "text": "${@i18n.loading}"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "xpage.reloadPage"
        },
        {
          "action": "ui.hideLoading"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
